          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("It’s a relief to once again breathe the fresh air. Where are we now?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("These are the Estmark hills, so we must be in a mountain pass leading both east and west. I am unsure which path leads us the swiftest towards Wesnoth, but we certainly cannot stay here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Kallat",
            text: _("What are these soldiers doing here? The vanguard must not have done a thorough job of cleaning up..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Skraat",
            text: _("Don’t be scared, Kala. Look at how haggard they are! I bet the new recruit can handle them by himself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Tar",
            text: _("No!! They’ll kill me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal-Skraat",
            text: _("We can always bring you back if you die."),
          },
        ],
