            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I believe this is the undead rearguard; we must have crossed under their armies while in the tunnel. We must kill either of the dark sorcerers and escape towards Wesnoth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("This is a true invasion then? These necromancers mean to conquer Wesnoth itself?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Yes. I have history with their leader."),
          },
        ],
